			"text": "No fsync per message. \"Durable\" = in the memory of >= 2 brokers.\nPostgres COMMIT waits for a WAL fsync; Kafka acks=all waits for\nreplicas. Losing all of them at once could still lose data.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "k398",
			"originalText": "No fsync per message. \"Durable\" = in the memory of >= 2 brokers.\nPostgres COMMIT waits for a WAL fsync; Kafka acks=all waits for\nreplicas. Losing all of them at once could still lose data.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"index": "c14t",
			"created": null,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
