			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Stage 2 promise: per-tenant order inside a partition is a Kafka property we benefit from, not a guarantee the system exposes.\noccurred_at (client time) and received_at (API time) are the real ordering data, handled in a later stage.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 1,
