			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "k2 hashed to P1 before and goes to P4 after.\nRecords written before and after the alter now sit in\ndifferent partitions: per-key order across the change is lost.",
			"fontSize": 16,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "k632",
			"originalText": "k2 hashed to P1 before and goes to P4 after.\nRecords written before and after the alter now sit in\ndifferent partitions: per-key order across the change is lost.",
